      "date": "2026-05-27T16:07:32.000Z",
      "title": "GREENPANEL: Future P/E Repricing Will Support Upcoming Dividend Decisions",
      "body": "Analysts have revised their price target for Greenpanel Industries from about ₹308 to around ₹243, reflecting updated assumptions for lower revenue growth and profit margins, partly offset by a higher future P/E and a reduced discount rate. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for May 15, 2026, at 17:00 IST to consider and approve the audited financial results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2026, along with the auditor's report for the same period (Key Developments).",
