      "title": "Price target decreased by 13% to ₹256",
      "body": "Down from ₹293, the current price target is an average from 16 analysts. New target price is 40% above last closing price of ₹183. Stock is down 27% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹6.51 next year compared to a net loss per share of ₹2.38 last year.",
