      "date": "2026-05-17T22:58:04.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS misses analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: ₹2.38 loss per share (down from ₹5.88 profit in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹15.5b (up 8.2% from FY 2025). Net loss: ₹291.3m (down 140% from profit in FY 2025). Revenue was in line with analyst estimates. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates. Revenue is forecast to grow 17% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 7.5% growth forecast for the Forestry industry in Asia. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 70 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
